{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/43c336","slideIndex":3,"text":"Source: revised draft support proposal dated October 30, 2026, output/pdf/WaistLess-Foods-Support-Proposal-Draft.pdf. This is an illustrative plan pending a team estimate and final scope, not committed monthly quantities. One newsletter draft uses the existing template, up to 600 words of supplied final copy, one call-to-action link, and one consolidated revision round. Each of four static graphics has one agreed message and size, based on approved templates, with one consolidated revision round. Each of two content updates covers one existing page or recipe entry using final supplied text and one supplied image. Website checks and minor fixes must fit the agreed technical scope. The monthly review is up to 30 minutes. Ask which work Amber actually wants to hand over."}
