{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/i01o46","slideIndex":10,"text":"HIDDEN APPENDIX. Normal slideshow playback skips this slide. Show it manually only if Amber asks about budget after discussing her recurring tasks. Source: revised draft support proposal dated October 30, 2026. Website support is provisionally USD $300 per month with up to five combined service hours for technical work and coordination. Monthly Website & Content Support is provisionally USD $700 per month with fifteen combined staff hours: five technical, eight design/admin, and two coordination/review. These are planning limits in the detailed terms, not extra production time above the sample deliverables. Meetings, revisions, testing, and reporting count. The content plan on slide 4 is illustrative and must be estimated before quantities are promised. Confirm staffing, full delivery cost, and final scope before issuing a quote. One newsletter draft, four graphics, two updates, a website check with small fixes, and a monthly review are the proposed example, not a committed output package."}